              88.0,
              1171.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Firms making weapons for the Ministry of Defence and for export have been effectively excluded from attending events on campus at some universities, or forced to cancel them themselves, raising concerns that national security could be put at risk as a result of a skills shortage in vital industries.",
