          "block_content": "In recent months, some 20 defence companies are believed to have been advised against attending careers fairs and university events because of security and safety fears, or decided to cancel them amid pressure, according to Kevin Craven, chief executive of the ADS group, which represents defence, aerospace and security companies. Those that did attend faced intimidation and harassment, he said.",
